This is extrapolation, because week $8.5$ is beyond the last recorded week (week $8$).
Extending the line gives a predicted height of about $30.5$ cm.
However, because week $8.5$ is only slightly beyond the recorded data, this prediction is comparatively more reliable than extrapolating much further, such as to week $20$.
